 soir.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Fortunately, everything went well and we arrived in the evening.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Heureusement, tout s'est bien passé et nous sommes arrivés le soir.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276067,"_nanoseconds":845000000}},{"id":"LtIvVyBKoTAfdJuL4Xwx","level":"a2","lesson":24,"part":12,"type":"text","name":"a2-l24-p12-b1","partTitle":"Speak freely","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.4rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Racontez un événement.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0 0 10px;\">Tell an event.</p><p><b>Tell a story with context, an incident and an ending.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.7;\">For example: “Un jour, nous voyagions. Soudain, la voiture est tombée en panne. Heureusement, tout s'est bien passé.”</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Now it's your turn to speak!","expectedText":"Un jour, nous voyagions. Soudain, la voiture est tombée en panne. Heureusement, tout s'est bien passé.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276067,"_nanoseconds":831000000}},{"id":"5kGajOlsN2zVazrTO8q8","level":"a2","lesson":24,"part":13,"type":"text","name":"a2-l24-p13-b1","partTitle":"Well done","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:64px;line-height:1.1;\">📣</div><p><b>Event told!</b></p></div><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">🧑‍🏫 You can tell a three-minute story with context, action and ending. A key skill for A2.</p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276067,"_nanoseconds":992000000}}]